the User is a set.
this's Name is a text.

the SaveData is a set.
this's Path is a text.

the Sorter is an actor.
this's Item is a User.

this can Tell.
this's Tell does...
    when this's Item is User?
        log "user".
    or when this's Item is SaveData?
        log "save".
    or?
        log "unknown".
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

Sorter's Item is a User with Name "Chris".
do Sorter's Tell.

Sorter's Item is a SaveData with Path "/p".
do Sorter's Tell.
